  "description": "The intention of the proposed alterations to the Lower Ground Floor flat at no. 4A Manley Street is to create a comfortable 1 bedroom flat with generous living spaces, which allow for the maximum penetration of daylight and make the most of the amenity of the external courtyard. \n\n3 no. existing windows overlooking the external courtyard, will be repositioned to allow them to be centred on the new spaces created: the Living Room, Kitchen and Dining Room. A small existing external door will become redundant as a result.\n\nThe newly positioned window openings will be extended to allow for French doors, providing better views and direct access to the courtyard. This will be done with care and any new infill brickwork will match the existing London stock brick. \n",
